{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared parity cases for the plan completeness validator.",
    "",
    "planValidator.js (Express, authoritative gate at /plan/approve) and",
    "plan_completeness.go (engine, in-loop feedback every turn) are hand-mirrored",
    "implementations of one rule set. Nothing in either language forces them to",
    "agree, and when they drift the failure is nasty in both directions: the",
    "in-loop feedback says the plan is done while Express rejects it, or the model",
    "burns turns chasing a bar Express never enforced.",
    "",
    "Every case below pins the EXACT set of rule ids both must produce. A change",
    "to either implementation that is not made in the other fails here.",
    "",
    "This file is duplicated at writing-engine/internal/engine/testdata/",
    "parity-cases.json because the two live in separate git repos and neither can",
    "read the other's tree in CI. Edit both, or the copies drift and the test",
    "silently stops comparing anything.",
    "",
    "Briefs are given as targetWordCount only; section word targets sum to it so",
    "the wordBudget rule never fires and pollutes the expected sets."
  ],
  "brief": { "targetWordCount": 1000 },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "complete plan passes",
      "expectedRules": [],
      "plan": {
        "targetAudience": "a", "angle": "b", "thesis": "c",
        "alternatives": [{ "label": "A", "chosen": false }, { "label": "B", "chosen": true, "reason": "r" }],
        "risks": [{ "description": "r" }],
        "sections": [
          { "id": "s1", "heading": "One", "headingLevel": 2, "wordTarget": 300,
            "keyPoints": [
              { "text": "k1", "evidence": [{ "path": "/competitors/a.md", "quote": "q1", "reason": "r" }] },
              { "text": "k2", "evidence": [{ "path": "/subtopics/b.md", "quote": "q2", "reason": "r" }] }
            ] },
          { "id": "s2", "heading": "Two", "headingLevel": 2, "wordTarget": 300,
            "keyPoints": [
              { "text": "k3", "evidence": [{ "path": "/competitors/a.md", "quote": "q3", "reason": "r" }] },
              { "text": "k4", "evidence": [{ "path": "/keywords/primary.md", "quote": "q4", "reason": "r" }] }
            ] },
          { "id": "s3", "heading": "Three", "headingLevel": 2, "wordTarget": 400,
            "keyPoints": [
              { "text": "k5", "evidence": [{ "path": "/subtopics/b.md", "quote": "q5", "reason": "r" }] },
              { "text": "k6", "evidence": [{ "path": "/competitors/a.md", "quote": "q6", "reason": "r" }] }
