    {
      "name": "an evidenceMap entry keyed to a section with no id cannot be matched",
      "expectedRules": ["sections[1].evidence.density"],
      "_note": [
        "Documents a real limitation rather than asserting desired behaviour:",
        "per-section counting joins on section.id, so refs parked under a key that",
        "matches no section id are invisible to the floor even though the plan",
        "does carry them. Section ids are required by the model and the JSON Patch",
        "whitelist, so this should not arise — but if it ever does, the failure is",
        "unsatisfiable-looking and this case is the explanation."
      ],
